        <mxCell id="c33" value="&lt;i&gt;Hours needed are the 2026 output of 68,913 standard hours times each scenario&#x27;s ratio. Regular capacity is 64 hourly employees × 8 hours × 256 working days of 2026, because the calendar stops early in 2027. Every scenario fits inside it on the year&#x27;s total, so the plan allows no routine overtime. Weeks and work centers can still bind, so any exception is approved against a dated plan.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="408" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
